  "releaseNotes": "--APR 2026: Added HMAC-based BarCodeGenerator, sealed classes, and applied trimming annotations across Core.\n\t  --MAY 2026: Refactored Ulid Base32 decoding for zero-allocation performance, extracted Crockford32 and AssemblyExtensionsHelper, optimized DistinctBlockingCollection and JSON serialization, and added InvalidValueException and Config APIs with tests.\n\t  --JUN-JUL 2026: Added new .NET 10+ APIs and validation, introduced InformationScanner, enhanced trim safety, and refactored to PerformanceStopwatch.\n\t  --AUG 2026: Added ThreadPoolHelper, expanded BenchmarkDotNet coverage, refined Crockford32, and marked EnumHelper, TypeHelper, TaskHelper, NetworkHelper, and JsonSerialization APIs as stable.\n\t  --OCT 2026: Added ThreadPoolHelper and ThreadPoolStatistics APIs, added CodeCredit property to InformationAttribute, updated Crockford32 documentation, marked EnumHelper, NetworkHelper, JsonSerialization, TypeHelper, and TaskHelper APIs as stable, and updated OpenTelemetry.Api dependency to 1.18.0.",
